ules that might affect the frontend-proxy\'s operation.\n</think>\n\nexec_read_only_kubectl_cmd  \nThe frontend-proxy pod is in a "Terminating" state, but the deployment and service configurations appear correct. To determine why the pod is terminating, I will check the pod\'s events for errors or warnings that might indicate crashes, evictions, or misconfigurations. This will help identify if the termination is due to a fault in the pod itself or external factors.  \n\n<tool_call>\n{"name": "exec_read_only_kubectl_cmd", "arguments": {"command": "kubectl describe pod frontend-proxy-84788b44b-gtgdz -n astronomy-shop"}}\n</tool_call>', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=653, prompt_tokens=4108, total_tokens=4761, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfbfa-a8ac-7d83-bb5f-72a88a36cc79-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 4108, 'output_tokens': 653, 'total_tokens': 4761}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='965284bd-290a-41ec-8628-8c9e20a172ff')]]
